WEBVTT

01:42:03.792 --> 01:42:05.250
His men are looking for Surya.

01:42:05.375 --> 01:42:06.334
They shouldn't find him.

01:42:06.459 --> 01:42:07.417
Hey!

01:42:07.667 --> 01:42:08.917
He has fallen asleep.

01:42:09.250 --> 01:42:11.125
-What do you want me to do?
-How can I tell you?

01:42:11.875 --> 01:42:13.459
They'll be coming home. Do something.
